              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "le blessé — \"the injured person, the casualty\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Les blessés ont été emmenés à l'hôpital. The injured were taken to hospital."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Un blessé grave, un blessé léger — a seriously, a slightly injured person."
            }
          ]
        },
